tem\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"images/login/provide-icon2.png\" alt=\"H5一键登录\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-name\">H5一键登录</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-desc\">在H5页面、小程序、快应用中，用户补全中间四位号码，实现快速注册登录。</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-phone\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"images/login/ct-pic2.png\" alt=\"H5一键登录\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"images/login/provide-icon3.png\" alt=\"本机号码校验\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-name\">本机号码校验</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-desc\">应用提供待校验的号码，与本机号码进行比对，返回是否本机号码的结果。</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"provide-phone\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"images/login/ct-pic3.png\" alt=\"本机号码校验\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<!-- 产品优势 -->\n\t\t<div class=\"section advantage-section\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-title\">产品优势</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-grid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\talt=\"登录过程2秒内比传统登录方式快10倍\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-desc\">登录过程2秒内比传统登录方式快10倍</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\talt=\"可避免密码撞库泄露或短验被劫持泄露\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-desc\">可避免密码撞库泄露或短验被劫持泄露</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\talt=\"登录即注册 注册转化率提升20%以上\">\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"advantage-desc\">登录即注册 注册转化率提升20%以上</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<!-- 应用场景 -->\n\t\t<div class=\"section scene-section\" id=\"scene-section\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-title\">应用场景</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"scene-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"scene-tab active\" data-target=\"scene-login\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img id=\"icon-login\" src=\"images/login/scene-tab-login.png\" alt=\"一键登录能力\">\n\t\t\t\t\t一键登录能力\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"scene-tab\" data-target=\"scene-verify\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img id=\"icon-verify\" src=\"images/login/scene-tab-verify-inactive.png\" alt=\"本机号码校验能力\">\n\t\t\t\t\t本机号码校验能力\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"scene-panel active\" id=\"scene-login\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__nav-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__nav-scroll\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__nav\" role=\"tablist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__active-bar\" style=\"width: 33.33%;\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__item is-active\" data-verify=\"login-register\">注册登录</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__item\" data-verify=\"login-order\">业务订购</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__item\" data-verify=\"login-bind\">号码绑定</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tabs__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"el-tab-pane is-active\" id=\"login-register\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pane-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pane-small-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pane-leftbox-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"pane-left-title\">一键登录/注册</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"pane-left-desc\">用户一键授权即可使用本机号码完成账号登录、注册，优化用户体验和业务流程，提高用户留存率。</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pane-small-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"images/login/yycj-icon1.gif\" alt=\"一键登录/注册\" class=\"pane-box-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>